@startuml
title Launch Manager - "Normal" Shutdown

autonumber "<b>[00]"

participant "Launch Manager" as LM
participant "OS (kernel)" as kernel
participant "setup_filesystems.sh" as fs
participant "random" as ran
participant "app1" as app1
participant "StateManager" as sm

activate LM
activate app1
activate ran
activate sm

note over LM,sm
The Run Target "Running" is currently active.
end note

[-> LM : SIGTERM
LM -> LM : Determine transition plan to Run Target "Off"

ref over LM, app1
  Transition to Run Target "Off":
  all Components are terminated in dependency order.
end ref

LM -> LM : Run Target "Off" successfully activated

destroy app1
destroy ran
destroy sm

LM -> LM : Deinitialize, free resources
[<- LM : exit
destroy LM
...
@enduml
